effectText:
You cannot add cards from the Main Deck to your hand during the Duel you activate this card's effect, except by drawing them. (Quick Effect): You can discard this card, then activate 1 of these effects (but you can only use each effect of "Squeeze, the New Moon of Raise Moon" once per turn);
●This turn, each time a card(s) is added to your opponent's hand, except by drawing it, draw 1 card, also you cannot Special Summon from the Extra Deck until the end of the next turn after this effect resolves, except Rank 7 Xyz Monsters.
●Draw 1 card.
